package migration
    provides [m08_slice, claim_m08_identity_problems, validate_m08_claim, campaign_m08_manifest]
    uses [coverage, reducer, registry, spec, text]

/// Z01 migration-coverage reconciliation, slice m08 (CORE-011..CORE-047).
/// Per-row facet, variant, environment and delegated-declaration mappings
